      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHARGE THE CARD (2) finished second (20.09) two back at Gunnedah but out of the placings last time when 6th at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings seven times from 12 starts. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. RAVEN FIRE (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (19.02) in a Grade 4 at this track. A big run wouldn't surprise. MISS MACIE LYN (8) was unwanted in betting when starting from the same box but ran very well, finishing in the minors over 318m at this track in a Mix 2/3 in 18.61. Has the ability and looks a key chance. VALENTINO BEACH (7) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
